<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Simplified, hand-built model of downtown Toronto (Spadina to Yonge, Queen to Front).
     OSM-style XML read with BeautifulSoup. Geometry is an idealised 60 m grid in local metres
     (x east, y south); it is NOT survey data from OpenStreetMap.
     Traffic control: highway=traffic_signals (signal:offset = seconds into the 46 s cycle), highway=stop
     with stop=all (all-way stop) or stop=minor + control:approach (h = east-west traffic stops, v = north-south),
     highway=give_way + control:approach for yield signs. Each way carries its own maxspeed in km/h. -->
